                <p>Documentation on the U.S.–Yugoslav economic talks in Washington, Nov. 12–22,
                    1954, is scheduled for publication in <ref target="frus1952-54v08">volume <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">viii</hi></ref>.</p>
